{"4624930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "aeroDays", "steam_appid": 4624930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a co-op platformer where you clean up a colorful world using water. Simple, spraying things with water while your friends are also spraying things with water gets pretty fun pretty fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The setting is inspired by early-2000s era of translucent colorful plastic, glass architecture, and technology that genuinely felt exciting. It's a world that's a bit nostalgic, a bit silly, and nice to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The water mechanics go further than cleaning. You can use them to move around, reach unexpected places, and generally cause problems. Some areas are calm and pretty. Others get chaotic once you throw a few friends in. Both are good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's character customization, a handful of strange corners worth finding, and movement that borrows from the classic 3D platformers that era produced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Responsive 3D platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water that cleans and moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world full of glass, greenery, soft light, and water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early-2000s visual nostalgia done with care</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a co-op platformer where you clean up a colorful world using water. Simple, spraying things with water while your friends are also spraying things with water gets pretty fun pretty fast.</p><p class=\"bb_para